base-branch.value | profile base_branch | must not be blank
capacity.name | profile capacity "Bad_Capacity" | name must match [a-z0-9-]+ or provider:[a-z0-9-]+
capacity.value | profile capacity "Bad_Capacity" | capacity must be at least 1
check.argv | profile check "Bad_Check" | argv must contain a non-empty executable at index 0
check.name | profile check "Bad_Check" | name must match [a-z0-9-]+
command.argv | profile command "Bad_Command" | argv must contain a non-empty executable at index 0
command.name | profile command "Bad_Command" | name must match [a-z0-9-]+
disposition.value | profile disposition | must be manual, auto-pr, or auto-merge
mcp-server.value | profile mcp_servers[0] | server name must not be empty
mcp-server.duplicate | profile mcp_servers[2] | server "github" is duplicated
reliability.backoff | profile reliability.backoff[0] | must be greater than 0
reliability.backoff | profile reliability.backoff[1] | must be a time.ParseDuration-compatible string
reliability.budget | profile reliability.per_item_budget | exactly one of tokens, usd, or wall_clock must be set
reliability.budget-tokens | profile reliability.per_item_budget.tokens | must be at least 1
reliability.budget-usd | profile reliability.per_item_budget.usd | must be a finite value greater than 0
reliability.budget-wall-clock | profile reliability.per_item_budget.wall_clock | must be greater than 0
reliability.watchdog | profile reliability.watchdog | must be a time.ParseDuration-compatible string
secret.name | profile secret "Bad_Source" | name must match [a-z0-9-]+
secret.source | profile secret "Bad_Source" | source must be env or file
secret.env | profile secret "env-fields" | env source requires a non-empty env field
secret.path | profile secret "env-fields" | env source must not set path
secret.env | profile secret "file-fields" | file source must not set env
secret.path | profile secret "file-fields" | file source requires a non-empty path field
worktree-setup.moved | profile worktree_setup | worktree setup moved to Settings → Projects (worktree setup); move the recipe there and remove this block
